        "juan": "上卷·卷19",
        "section": "卷19",
        "line_ref": "段落42"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_L043",
      "original_quote": "天貴日春甲乙夏丙丁秋庚辛冬壬癸",
      "tag": [],
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "_source": {
        "text": "奇門遁甲秘笈大全",
        "juan": "上卷·卷19",
        "section": "卷19",
        "line_ref": "段落43"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_L044",
      "original_quote": "四順日建宜行、成宜離、寅宜往、卯宜歸。",
      "tag": [],
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "_source": {
        "text": "奇門遁甲秘笈大全",
        "juan": "上卷·卷19",
        "section": "卷19",
        "line_ref": "段落44"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_L045",
      "original_quote": "四逆日申不行、酉不離、七不往、八不歸。",
      "tag": [],
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "_source": {
        "text": "奇門遁甲秘笈大全",
        "juan": "上卷·卷19",
