      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "_source": {
        "text": "奇門遁甲秘笈大全",
        "juan": "上卷·卷19",
        "section": "卷19",
        "line_ref": "段落74"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_L075",
      "original_quote": "寶倉日，出行大人見喜，百事通達，求財遂意，衣錦還鄉，用之大吉。",
      "tag": [],
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "_source": {
        "text": "奇門遁甲秘笈大全",
        "juan": "上卷·卷19",
        "section": "卷19",
        "line_ref": "段落75"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_L076",
      "original_quote": "中元將軍所管四仲月出行吉凶，二、五、八、十一月",
      "tag": [],
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "_source": {
        "text": "奇門遁甲秘笈大全",
        "juan": "上卷·卷19",
        "section": "卷19",
        "line_ref": "段落76"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_L077",
      "original_quote": "天盜日，出行求財不成，口舌臨身大凶。",
      "tag": [],
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "_source": {
        "text": "奇門遁甲秘笈大全",
        "juan": "上卷·卷19",
        "section": "卷19",
        "line_ref": "段落77"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_L078",
      "original_quote": "天門日，出行所求皆遂，萬事如意，貴人接引，大吉。",
      "tag": [],
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "_source": {
        "text": "奇門遁甲秘笈大全",
        "juan": "上卷·卷19",
        "section": "卷19",
        "line_ref": "段落78"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_L079",
      "original_quote": "天堂日，出行求財得財，好人相逢，凡事俱吉。",
      "tag": [],
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "_source": {
        "text": "奇門遁甲秘笈大全",
        "juan": "上卷·卷19",
        "section": "卷19",
        "line_ref": "段落79"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_L080",
      "original_quote": "天財日原文缺",
      "tag": [],
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "_source": {
        "text": "奇門遁甲秘笈大全",
        "juan": "上卷·卷19",
        "section": "卷19",
        "line_ref": "段落80"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_L081",
      "original_quote": "天賊日，求財失落，見官無理，諸事不成，大凶。",
