        "line_ref": "段落92"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_L093",
      "original_quote": "青龍足日，求財不遂，見官失理，凶。",
      "tag": [],
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "_source": {
        "text": "奇門遁甲秘笈大全",
